7. Patches in Git
        
        Patch = text file containing changes between commits.

Steps to Create Patch
1. Clone Repo
git clone <repo-url>

2. Edit Files & Commit
git add .
git commit -m "message"

3. View Commit Log
git log


Copy commit hash.

4. Create Patch
git format-patch -1 <commit-hash>


Creates:

0001-commit-message.patch


For last 3 commits:

git format-patch -3


For commit range:

git format-patch <base-commit>..HEAD


Send the .patch file to owner.

Applying Patch (Owner Side)

Apply patch:

git apply my-changes.patch


or for Git-generated patch:

git am 0001-Your-commit-message.patch
